{
    "title": "Word Yatzy - Fun Word Puzzler",
    "description": "Word Yatzy is your new favorite word game. What happens when you combine classic scrabble board and add the amazing gameplay of Yahtzee? Meet Word Yatzy - the best new game to train your brain.\r\n\r\nWord Yatzy is more than just a scrabble game with friends. How good are you at spotting words from a random set of letters? Do you have the Yahtzee skills to fill all 5 slots and score big?! Get ready to test your word and strategy skills on this new addictive word game!\r\nIn this game, you have unlimited games and unlimited boards. Play as much as you want, as long as you want, against as many people as you want. No limits on your play at all! That\u2019s because we believe in the power of play!\r\n\r\nWord Yatzy is a turn-based game where two players compete for the highest score.\r\n- Start with 7 letters and use those letters to create words and play them on the gameboard for a ton of points.\r\n- Roll your letters like dice to see if you can build those high-scoring words.\r\n- Place high scoring letters (hello Z and Q) on tile bonuses for huge rounds!\r\n- If you can fill all 5 slots, you\u2019re guaranteed a huge +100 bonus!\r\n- No time limit on moves means you can play at your own pace\r\n- Games are 5 rounds and quick! Finish a game in minutes and start another one!\r\n\r\nPlay with a friend or other Word Yatzy players - people are always ready to play!\r\n\r\nCLASSIC GAMEPLAY WITH A TWIST\r\n\r\nPLAY WITH FRIENDS AND FAMILY\r\n\r\nFIND YOUR MATCH\r\n\r\nThis free puzzle word game will be a new anchor in your phone. With quick turns, Word Yatzy is the perfect word game to fill those \u201cwaiting for the bus\u201d moments. It\u2019s a great way to sharpen your mind and train your brain. Use all those letter tiles and get them on the board for the highest points. Do you have the skills to compete? We hope you enjoy and relax with Word Yatzy like millions of other players. This game continues to grow - we hope you join our fans and help us keep growing the word community! Come join us!\r\n\r\nWord Yatzy is the most addictive and enjoyable way to train your brain. Yatzy!\r\nFunCraft proudly made Word Yatzy. We make daily ritual word games and hope you enjoy your experience!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.funcraft.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nTerms of Service:\r\nhttps://www.funcraft.com/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "Word Yatzy is your new favorite word game. What happens when you combine classic scrabble board and add the amazing gameplay of Yahtzee? Meet Word Yatzy - the best new game to train your brain.<br><br>Word Yatzy is more than just a scrabble game with friends. How good are you at spotting words from a random set of letters? Do you have the Yahtzee skills to fill all 5 slots and score big?! Get ready to test your word and strategy skills on this new addictive word game!<br>In this game, you have unlimited games and unlimited boards. Play as much as you want, as long as you want, against as many people as you want. No limits on your play at all! That\u2019s because we believe in the power of play!<br><br>Word Yatzy is a turn-based game where two players compete for the highest score.<br>- Start with 7 letters and use those letters to create words and play them on the gameboard for a ton of points.<br>- Roll your letters like dice to see if you can build those high-scoring words.<br>- Place high scoring letters (hello Z and Q) on tile bonuses for huge rounds!<br>- If you can fill all 5 slots, you\u2019re guaranteed a huge +100 bonus!<br>- No time limit on moves means you can play at your own pace<br>- Games are 5 rounds and quick! Finish a game in minutes and start another one!<br><br>Play with a friend or other Word Yatzy players - people are always ready to play!<br><br>CLASSIC GAMEPLAY WITH A TWIST<br><br>PLAY WITH FRIENDS AND FAMILY<br><br>FIND YOUR MATCH<br><br>This free puzzle word game will be a new anchor in your phone. With quick turns, Word Yatzy is the perfect word game to fill those \u201cwaiting for the bus\u201d moments. It\u2019s a great way to sharpen your mind and train your brain. Use all those letter tiles and get them on the board for the highest points. Do you have the skills to compete? We hope you enjoy and relax with Word Yatzy like millions of other players. This game continues to grow - we hope you join our fans and help us keep growing the word community! Come join us!<br><br>Word Yatzy is the most addictive and enjoyable way to train your brain. Yatzy!<br>FunCraft proudly made Word Yatzy. We make daily ritual word games and hope you enjoy your experience!<br><br>Privacy Policy:<br>https://www.funcraft.com/privacy-policy<br><br>Terms of Service:<br>https://www.funcraft.com/terms-of-use",
